Error [E0312]: Secret-bearing `Secret` values cannot use `==`
  --> tests/ui/crypto_secret_compare.jet:7:11
    |
  7 |     print(first == second)
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Ordinary equality may leak secret information through timing and secret-bearing crypto types never implement comparison
 Fix: Use `core.crypto.constant_time_equal` for `Secret` values; compare public keys through their canonical `.bytes()` values
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0312
